  "system": {
    "description": {
      "value": "<p>Your explorations have reached their apex, fully infusing you with the essence of something beyond what you were when you began your path. This itself is, of course, only transitory still, as the journey of Change never ends.</p>\n<p><strong>Prerequisite:</strong> Membership in the Cocoon Pact base attack bonus +9, Minor Becoming, Major Becoming, Nascent Becoming.</p>\n<p><strong>Benefit:</strong> Choose one template such as half-celestial, half-fiend, or half-dragon (with other templates subject to GM approval and thematic fit to your character’s evolution). You gain the permanent effects of this choice as an acquired template.</p>\n<p><strong>Special:</strong> You may select this feat more than once, with GM approval, selecting a different template each time.</p>\n<p><a href=\"http://spheresofpower.wikidot.com/seraph-feats#toc84\">Source: Spheres of Power Wiki</a></p>",
      "instructions": ""
    },
